{"id": "t017-013", "text": "Ming's sister Hana getting married in Taipei, 3rd of Oct. Ming's bridesmaid + doing a speech in Mandarin AND English, v nervous, says her Mandarin's rusty. flying out the wk before w/ her bf Reza. she's asked me to listen to a practice run next Tues. remind me to text her good luck the morning of", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Taipei", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of Oct", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "bf", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "practice run", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tues", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t017-019", "text": "Francesca (Fran) - gallery opening this weekend, her first solo show. ask how it went the Mon after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fran", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gallery opening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Mon after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t017-023", "text": "Layla & Yusuf - engagement party Sat 8th @ hers. gift list on John Lewis. need to chip in w/ Kiara", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat 8th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gift list on John Lewis", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in w/ Kiara", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t017-030", "text": "Lorenzo - stressed abt wedding budget. venue deposit due Fri, caterer's quote came in way over. Francesca's parents offered to help but he's too proud. not sleeping much. also his band's playing a gig @ the Fleece 2 wks Sat, says it's a nice distraction. check in w/ him next wk, maybe take him for a pint", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lorenzo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "too proud", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig @ the Fleece", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 wks Sat", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w/ him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next wk", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t017-031", "text": "Olivia's bro Oscar - band playing @ Rough Trade 17 May. she wants a crowd, I said yes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bro", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing @ Rough Trade", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 May", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t017-033", "text": "Seo-yeon - dropped out of the Berlin half, injured hamstring. gutted. physio Tues", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dropped out of the Berlin half", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "injured hamstring", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t017-035", "text": "Karan - play opening Thurs @ Questors, he's Malvolio in Twelfth Night. lines still shaky, director's been on at him. runs til Sat. his wife Aditi + their kids coming Fri. I've got tix for Sat. remind me to text break a leg that morning, then get flowers to bring after the show", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play opening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "director", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "til Sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text break a leg", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get flowers to bring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the show", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t017-039", "text": "Vanessa - drama school recall 22nd June @ RADA. rehearsing monologue every night, doing Lady Macbeth. very nervous, her dad more so - he keeps ringing her. results 2 wks after. she's working at the cafe to save for fees. don't forget to text her the night before, and ask how it went that evening", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drama school recall", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22nd June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 wks after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "working at the cafe", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t017-043", "text": "Aiko - wedding planning hell. Mother-in-law wants church, she wants registry office. call her this weekend", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "planning hell", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t017-051", "text": "Kiara - triathlon 3rd of Aug, Windsor. training 6 days/wk, swimming 5am before work. her partner Ali thinks she's mad. she's raising money for the hospice that looked after her nan - link on her insta. ask her how training's going in a couple wks + sponsor her by end of July", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "triathlon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of Aug", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 days/wk"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "5am before work"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "raising money for the hospice", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how training's going", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a couple wks", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sponsor her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of July", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t017-054", "text": "Lin + Anders - married 1 yr next Tues (paper anniv). Lin wants notebook-y things. maybe a nice journal from me", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tues", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paper anniv", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants notebook-y things", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a nice journal", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
